<title>ESTONIA: HANSPANK TAKES NEW INSURANCE POLICIES.</title>
<headline>HANSPANK TAKES NEW INSURANCE POLICIES.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansapank group will take a new Bankers Blanket Bond/Computer Crime insurance agreement from July 31, 1997, for one year, Hansapank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Hansapank said in a statement that the new agreement was brokered by the Swedish insurance brokerage Sakra Skog and Rosen, which belongs to the Jardin Group.</p>
<p>Hansapank said it has also taken a directors' and officers' liability insurance policy and a company reimbursement liability insurance policy, which entered into force from July 1 for one year.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
